 "stimulus_html": "For the following exercises, use the given figure.\n<br>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/8b9fd14ded715b29.png\" alt=\"Five graphs are titled graph S, graph T, graph U, graph V, and graph W. Graph S has five vertices: a, b, c, d, and e. Edges connect a b, a c, bc, c d, c e, and d e. Graph T has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. Edges connect a b, a e, b d, and d e. Graph U has 6 vertices: a, b, f, c, d, and e. Edges connect ab, a f, f d, b c, c d, d e, c e, and a c. Graph V has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. Edges connect a b, a d, a e, b d, and d e. Graph W has four vertices: a, b, d, and e. Edges connect a b, a d, and d e.\">\n",
